Source/test TypeScript (`pnpm run tsc`, `pnpm run tsc-test`), ESLint and Prettier on all ten changed files exited 0. [ESLint](https://github.com/13Cohen/lexical/blob/357bb810499d05054e7f1dde397bad0c02070488/packages/lexical/ime-cancellation-evidence/logs/v4-lint-final.log) reported 0 errors and 1 naming warning for the test's `slice` callback (`@lexical/rules-of-lexical`); the frozen spelling is retained. Generator drift, schema parity and clone/serialization are covered by the unit run. The previous Flow full-check reported `Found 0 errors` (exit 0); its 152 definition/config/lock inputs are unchanged, so it was reused. [Quality scope and log references](https://github.com/13Cohen/lexical/blob/357bb810499d05054e7f1dde397bad0c02070488/packages/lexical/ime-cancellation-evidence/quality-scope.json).

Final native capture: macOS 27.0.1 (26A434), arm64, system WKWebView/WebKit 22625.1.29.11.28; exact input source `com.apple.inputmethod.SCIM.ITABC`. The separate source fixture rebuild and evidence verification commands are:

```sh
node /path/to/ime-repro/build.mjs .
python3 /path/to/ime-repro/verify.py --checkout .
```

Actual verifier output, exit 0 ([log](https://github.com/13Cohen/lexical/blob/357bb810499d05054e7f1dde397bad0c02070488/packages/lexical/ime-cancellation-evidence/logs/final-native-verify.log), [raw events](https://github.com/13Cohen/lexical/blob/357bb810499d05054e7f1dde397bad0c02070488/packages/lexical/ime-cancellation-evidence/events.jsonl)):

```text
Native final active-node-v4: 14/14 scenarios passed (6 PlainText, 8 RichText).
All 276 DOM input/composition/key events and 64 keydowns are trusted; no modifier shortcut was used.
Exact system Pinyin verified; previous input source and application/focus restored.
Historical exact-upstream baseline reused: 6 missing-Enter failures; no baseline rerun.
```

All 14 following ordinary Enter presses dispatched once; consumed `229` keys did not cause an extra command/deletion. Space confirmation committed “你”; Enter confirmation committed raw “ni”. Cancellation, real NBSP, cross-paragraph text, active JSON/slices and independent copies passed. Seven cases invoke programmatic model APIs after a trusted native compositionstart, then continue real OS input/cancellation; these are explicit API/IME interactions, not remote collaboration. All 134 build inputs matched and the post-capture bundle rebuild was byte-identical.

Physical coverage is limited to this system WKWebView/Pinyin setup. Standalone Safari/Chrome/Firefox, other OSes/IMEs, CodeHighlight/custom-node native matrices, no-input immediate cancellation and live remote Yjs were not physically exercised. The full monorepo/CI matrix, E2E and release/site builds were not repeated; older full-suite results are historical only. Detailed environment/tool versions and reuse boundaries are in the evidence README.
